        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-05-21T14:37:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>That's why I don't play them as much. &nbsp;I really like more nuanced heroes, and the Vengeance heroes are just crazy strong. &nbsp;Naturalist will be really tough as well.Parse will be the hardest, since I'm actually missing 3 cards from her deck. &nbsp;Need to find that card list so I can order new ones.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>As an anecdote, I do not think I'v lost a game yet in which Naturalist was present.&nbsp;</p>",
